---
// "Home" at the top of every project page (Arthur's decision, 2026-09-30): a quiet control in
// the site's own chrome (.control: sheet, hairline, 2px radius; .feedback: 120ms opacity) with a
// house drawn in the same thin graphite line as the page's drawings. A plain link, so it is
// keyboard-reachable with the global focus ring and its visible text is its name. The icon is
// decoration. No motion of its own.
---

<a class="control feedback home" href="/">
  <svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
    <path d="M2 8 8 2.5 14 8M3.5 7v6.5h9V7M6.5 13.5V9.5h3v4"></path>
  </svg>
  Home
</a>
